{include "pages/partials/error-page.disyl" with {
    status_code: status_code|default:404,
    page_title:  page_title|default:''
}}
{* 404 — Not Found.
   Renders the shared kernel error card (Tailwind CDN design, uniform with
   500 / entry-module-unavailable / maintenance). Standard context contract:
   status_code, page_title, error_title, message, detail (gated by
   show_detail), back_url, action_label, icon, image — all optional with safe
   defaults derived from status_code. *}
